Implement in boot:
```
if (isTouch) {
 ui.titleControls.innerHTML = ...
 const cl = ui.pauseScreen.querySelector('.controls-list');
 if (cl) cl.innerHTML = `<div><kbd>left stick</kbd><span>crawl</span></div>...`;
}
```
Good.

Also title foot "Four small worlds" fine.

Now bigger concern: the game's "incremental" nature and stage progression. It works.

